== office | MORNING · CO-WORKING SPACE | bright co-working space with plants, big windows and laptops | desk @chidi
chidi (facepalm): I've applied to one hundred remote jobs. Zero replies. Even the scammers ignored me.
quddus (think): Show me your CV. Hmm. Three colours, two photos, and a font that looks like a wedding card.
chidi (shrug): I wanted it to look fancy.
quddus (talk): Many companies use software to scan CVs. Fancy designs can confuse it. Keep it simple and clear.
> 1f4cb | CV BASICS | 1f4cb Simple layout, standard font | 1f4cc Clear headings | 1f50e Keywords from the job post

== cafe | LATER · COFFEE SHOP | modern coffee shop with laptops, plants and warm lights | cafe +laptop
chidi (think): What should I write under experience?
quddus (point): Results, not duties. Not "responsible for social media", but "grew our page from two thousand to ten thousand followers in six months".
> 1f4c8 | WRITE RESULTS | 1f4c8 Use numbers | 1f3af Match the job's keywords | 1f4bb Add remote tools you know
chidi (talk): And I should change it for every job?
quddus (thumbs): Adjust it. Use the words from each job post that truly match your skills. Never lie.
chidi (cheer): Wedding card font: deleted. Numbers: added!
